\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Show me the way, O Lord,
\par And make it plain;
\par I would obey Thy Word,
\par Speak yet again;
\par I will not take one step
\par until I know
\par Which way it is that Thou 
\par wouldst have me go.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. O Lord, I cannot see!
\par Vouchsafe me light;
\par The mist bewilders me,
\par Impedes my sight;
\par Hold Thou my hand, and lead
\par me by Thy side;
\par I dare not go alone;
\par be Thou my Guide.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. I will be patient, Lord,
\par Trustful and still;
\par I will not doubt Thy Word;
\par My hopes fulfil:
\par How can I perish, clinging
\par to Thy side,
\par My Comforter, my Saviour, 
\par and my Guide?\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

